    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nIdeally situated just a 10-minute drive from Killarney and only 750 metres from Kilcummin Village, this impressive four bedroom bungalow on site of approximately 0.5 acres, enjoys a peaceful countryside setting with beautiful rural views.Set on a site of approximately half an acre, the property offers generous and well-proportioned accommodation throughout. The layout comprises a welcoming sitting room, a comfortable living room, a spacious kitchen/dining area, a utility room, four bedrooms, including a master bedroom with en-suite, and a family bathroom.Combining the tranquility of country living with the convenience of nearby village amenities and easy access to Killarney, this attractive home is an ideal choice for families seeking space, comfort, and a superb location."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 4.3 x 1.66\n\n\nSittingroom - 4.58 x 3.6\nDecorative open marble fireplace. Built in units, laminate timber flooring. Tongued and grooved timber ceiling.\n\nLiving Room - 4.6 x 3\nMarble fireplace with mahogany surround. Built in corner TV unit. Built in press. Tongued and grooved timber ceiling. Double aspect windows\n\nInner Hall (back) - 3.0 x 1.22\nRear door\n\nKitchen Dining Room - 5.3 x 3.2\nBuilt in oak units. Oil boiler\n\nUtility Room - 1.5 x 2.3\nShelving\n\nInner Hall - 1.1 x 1\n\n\nBedroom One - 4.1 x 3.0\n\n\nBedroom Two - 3 x 4.17\nBuilt in wardrobe\n\nHot Press/Linen Closet - \n\n\nBedroom Three - 2.9 x 4.8\nBuilt in wardrobe\n\nBedroom Four - 3.4 x 3.86\nBuilt in wardrobe\n\nEn Suite - 1.6 x 1.52\nElectric shower, wc, wash hand basin, fully tiled\n\nBathroom - 3 x 1\nBath with shower, wc, wash hand basin, fully tiled\n\nEXTERNAL - \n\n\nShed - \n\n\n"
      },
      {
